WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:02.826
Lesson seven. Food!

2
00:00:03.745 --> 00:00:10.612
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.632 --> 00:00:14.448
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.498 --> 00:00:17.067
Today we learn: Food! Let's go!

5
00:00:17.821 --> 00:00:21.371
Apple! Say it with me. Apple!

6
00:00:25.356 --> 00:00:28.923
Banana! Say it with me. Banana!

7
00:00:32.924 --> 00:00:36.240
Milk! Say it with me. Milk!

8
00:00:40.227 --> 00:00:43.627
Bread! Say it with me. Bread!

9
00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:50.946
Egg! Say it with me. Egg!

10
00:00:54.969 --> 00:00:58.802
Rice! Say it with me. Rice!

11
00:01:02.766 --> 00:01:06.233
Cheese! Say it with me. Cheese!

12
00:01:10.226 --> 00:01:13.709
Juice! Say it with me. Juice!

13
00:01:17.775 --> 00:01:23.818
Listen. I like milk. I don't like coffee.

14
00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:28.516
Say it with me. I like milk. I don't like coffee.

15
00:01:33.577 --> 00:01:39.791
I eat a sweet banana and drink warm milk for breakfast. I also like rice with cheese.

16
00:01:39.841 --> 00:01:41.276
I like this story!

17
00:01:42.077 --> 00:01:46.313
What's this?

18
00:01:46.363 --> 00:01:47.555
It's milk!

19
00:01:48.646 --> 00:01:53.003
What's this?

20
00:01:53.053 --> 00:01:54.355
It's rice!

21
00:01:55.441 --> 00:02:04.324
This is M. M is for moon. M is for monkey. This is N. N is for nose. N is for nest.

22
00:02:08.425 --> 00:02:15.608
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:15.658 --> 00:02:17.350
Bye-bye, friends!

